{"id":662,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Fletchinder are exceedingly territorial and aggressive. These Pokémon fight among themselves over feeding grounds."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Fletchinder launches embers into the den of its prey. When the prey comes leaping out, Fletchinder’s sharp talons finish it off."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its speed right after takeoff already puts it in the top speed class of all bird Pokémon."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It scatters embers in the tall grass. Then bug Pokémon, frightened by the flames, come flying out, and Fletchinder gobbles them up."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It will not tolerate other Fletchinder entering its territory, which has a radius of several miles."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"From its beak, it fires embers at its prey. Once it has caught them, it grills them at high heat before feasting upon them."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"The hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"From its beak, it expels embers that set the tall grass on fire. Then it pounces on the bewildered prey that pop out of the grass."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."},{"name":"Gale Wings","hidden":true,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's Flying-type moves while its HP is full."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":661,"name":"Fletchling","condition":null,"children":[{"id":662,"name":"Fletchinder","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":663,"name":"Talonflame","condition":"Lv. 35","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,488],[1,45],[1,52],[1,64],[1,98],[1,364],[15,175],[22,512],[29,97],[36,332],[43,366],[50,211],[57,355],[64,19]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,413,38,81